abstract: >-
  A/B evaluation report of J-Space V3.7 on DeepSeek V4-Flash-Vision-Exp across
  authoritative benchmark subsets (Terminal-Bench 2.1, DeepSWE, GAIA, etc.),
  with identical model, environment, and sampling — only the J-Space toggle
  differs. Two-factor measurement: accuracy and wall-clock. The report is
  licensed under CC BY-ND 4.0: share and cite with attribution; do not
  modify or distribute derivative works.
